<!--
  A simplified, monochrome version of the app's own wallet mark (see ic_launcher_foreground.xml) —
  a rounded-rect body with a clasp nub on the right edge — instead of the previous unrelated
  4-point sparkle glyph, so the status-bar icon reads as the same mark as the rest of the app.
  Android status-bar icons must be a plain white silhouette on transparent (the system tints it),
  so both shapes are solid white, not a stroke outline.
-->
